        {
          "text": "Ekibuga ekikologho kyayabikamu ebitundu bisatu, n'ebibuga eby'ensi dhoonadhoona byagwa. Katonda yaaloba kwerabira Babiloni ekibuga ekikologho, yaakigha okunhwa okumaliramu irala ekikopo eky'omwenge ogw'emizabbibu, omwenge ogw'obusungu bwe obungi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.16.19",
